  "properties": {
    "title": "GRID3 COD - Nord-Kivu- Geospatial Data Layers",
    "description": "Settlement names Health facilities Health zones Health areas To download the data, use the layer-specific links above. This data package supersedes the v8.0 GRID3 COD health areas, health facilities, health zones, and settlement names layers for Nord-Kivu Province only. It does not supersede versions of these layers for other provinces or geographies. This dataset may contain unintended omissions, as it was developed under a compressed timeline to enable timely information sharing and support teams engaged in emergency response efforts. For more information on the methodology and data sources used to produce this dataset, see the associated documentation.",
